### ════════════════════════════════════════════════
### EasyVote API - Tests
### Backend tourne sur http://localhost:8082
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082/api
@email = moez@test.com
@password = password123

### 1. Register - Création de compte
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Moez Kaabi",
  "studentId": "STU005"
}

### 2. Verify OTP - Remplace 123456 par le code reçu dans Mailtrap
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "code": "783625"
}

### 3. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 4. Resend OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 5. Get current user (collez le accessToken de la réponse login/verify-otp)
@accessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhaG1lZEB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsInVzZXJJZCI6MSwicm9sZSI6IkFETUlOIiwiZnVsbE5hbWUiOiJBaG1lZCBMdGF5ZWYiLCJpYXQiOjE3Nzc3NDU3MjQsImV4cCI6MTc3NzgzMjEyNH0.8fmok8hAIGWAVjVtuLTSfj0w_B1hdcoctA1JmgAFqU2oTev826my6gPjCvHQHz2hdSzrQVjNi8YA3oYHotP6Bw

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "COLLE_LE_REFRESH_TOKEN_ICI"
}

